#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph access is granted directly by a graph permission in every mode. Permissive also grants access when the user has permission for the graph's device or template. Restrictive requires permission for both the device and template when there is no direct graph permission. Device Based requires device permission, and Graph Template Based requires template permission. User and group policies are evaluated separately and their allowed results are combined. These modes trade query performance against fine-grained permissions on large installations."
msgstr "Akses graf diberikan secara langsung oleh kebenaran graf dalam setiap mod. Permisif juga memberikan akses apabila pengguna mempunyai kebenaran untuk peranti atau templat graf. Restriktif memerlukan kebenaran untuk kedua-dua peranti dan templat apabila tiada kebenaran graf langsung. Berasaskan Peranti memerlukan kebenaran peranti, dan Berasaskan Templat Graf memerlukan kebenaran templat. Dasar pengguna dan kumpulan dinilai secara berasingan dan keputusan yang dibenarkan digabungkan. Mod ini menukar prestasi pertanyaan dengan kebenaran terperinci pada pemasangan besar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Permisif"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Restriktif"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Berasaskan Peranti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Kaedah Penciptaan Graf/Sumber Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Jika ditetapkan kepada Mudah, Graf dan Sumber Data hanya boleh dicipta daripada Graf Baharu.  Jika Lanjutan, penciptaan Graf dan Sumber Data legasi disokong."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Mudah"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Lanjutan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Tunjukkan Bantuan Borang/Tetapan Sebaris"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be shown inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Apabila ditandakan, Bantuan Borang dan Tetapan akan ditunjukkan sebaris.  Jika tidak, ia akan dipaparkan apabila menuding pada butang bantuan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Bantuan Halaman Setempat Sahaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Kadupul page help is located at kadupul.org.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of your Kadupul server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Secara lalai bantuan halaman Kadupul terletak di kadupul.org.  Walau bagaimanapun, jika sistem anda tidak mempunyai akses ke Internet, anda boleh memuat turun dokumentasi secara setempat dalam format HTML dan menghosnya di lokasi 'docs' pelayan Kadupul anda.  Jika anda memilih untuk hanya menggunakan lokasi setempat bagi dokumentasi bantuan halaman, tandakan kotak semak ini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Pengesahan Pemadaman"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Gesa pengguna sebelum item dipadam."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Pratetap Pemeliharaan Sumber Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Kadupul will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Apabila didayakan, Kadupul akan menetapkan Butang Radio kepada Padam Sumber Data berkaitan bagi sesuatu Graf apabila membuang Graf.  Nota: Kadupul tidak akan membenarkan pembuangan Sumber Data jika ia digunakan dalam Graf lain."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Buka Kunci Graf Automatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allows a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Apabila didayakan, Kadupul tidak akan mengunci Graf.  Ini membolehkan pengubahsuaian manual yang lebih pantas bagi Sumber Data yang berkaitan dengan sesuatu Graf."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Kadupul Dashboard"
msgstr "Sembunyikan Papan Pemuka Kadupul"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Kadupul's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Kadupul Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Untuk digunakan dengan Sokongan Pautan Luaran Kadupul.  Dengan tetapan ini, anda boleh menyembunyikan Papan Pemuka Kadupul, supaya anda dapat memaparkan halaman anda sendiri sahaja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Dayakan Seret-dan-Lepas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Kadupul's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired users, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Sesetengah antara muka Kadupul menyokong Seret-dan-Lepas.  Jika ditandakan, pilihan ini akan didayakan.  Nota: Bagi pengguna cacat penglihatan, pilihan ini boleh dilumpuhkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Keselamatan Tapak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Paksa Sambungan melalui HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Kadupul will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Apabila ditandakan, sebarang percubaan untuk mengakses Kadupul akan dialihkan ke HTTPS bagi memastikan keselamatan yang tinggi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Benarkan HTTPS Pengumpul Data Jauh yang Tidak Selamat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Benarkan penggunaan Sijil Ditandatangani Sendiri dan benarkan nama hos Sijil berbeza daripada nama hos Pengumpul Data Jauh."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Benarkan Metaaksara Tidak Selamat dalam Kaedah Input Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Secara sejarah, pentadbir Kadupul mencipta Kaedah Input Data ringkas yang menyertakan arahan seperti \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" untuk mewakili nilai angka bagi digunakan dalam Graf Kadupul.  Dalam versi Kadupul terdahulu, ini dibenarkan.  Walau bagaimanapun, ini ialah amalan yang tidak selamat kerana ia menjadi pintu masuk bagi pengguna pihak ketiga untuk menerbitkan Templat Data yang tidak selamat.  Dalam Kadupul moden, amalan seperti ini patut dielakkan.  Walau bagaimanapun, kami menyediakan pilihan ini jika anda mempunyai Kaedah Input Data lama yang mengandungi Metaaksara tidak selamat ini dan belum menukarnya kepada skrip setempat dalam direktori 'scripts'.  Apabila pilihan ini tidak ditandakan, Kadupul menyekat metaaksara gaya shell seperti tanda petikan, pendakap kerinting, palang menegak, garis condong songsang, dan tanda petikan songsang.  Kadupul terus membenarkan tanda lebih besar daripada dan kurang daripada untuk perkara seperti <path_cacti> dan untuk parameter input, tetapi jika pilihan ini tidak ditandakan, itulah had penggunaan yang dibenarkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Dasar Skrip Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy. The Nonce Mode - Reporting Only choice reports inline scripts that lack a nonce without blocking them. The implementation also supports an enforcing nonce mode through direct configuration, but this mode is not offered here because many built-in pages and plugins still use inline scripts without nonces. Enabling enforcement before those scripts are migrated can break pages and plugins. Use CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute() when adding inline scripts."
msgstr "Mengawal dasar CSP script-src. Pilihan Mod Nonce - Pelaporan Sahaja melaporkan skrip sebaris yang tidak mempunyai nonce tanpa menyekatnya. Pelaksanaan ini juga menyokong mod nonce penguatkuasaan melalui konfigurasi langsung, tetapi mod ini tidak ditawarkan di sini kerana banyak halaman dan pemalam terbina dalam masih menggunakan skrip sebaris tanpa nonce. Mendayakan penguatkuasaan sebelum skrip tersebut dipindahkan boleh merosakkan halaman dan pemalam. Gunakan CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute() apabila menambah skrip sebaris."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Benarkan JavaScript Sebaris Tanpa Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Benarkan kedua-dua unsafe-eval dan JavaScript Sebaris Tanpa Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Mod Nonce - Pelaporan Sahaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI Laporan Pelanggaran CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL di mana pelayar melakukan POST laporan pelanggaran CSP dalam mod nonce-report dan nonce. Biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan <url_path>/csp_report.php. Mesti mengandungi aksara URL yang selamat sahaja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Sumber Alternatif Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Nama domain dipisahkan ruang yang akan dibenarkan diakses di luar Pelayan Web itu sendiri.  Ini penting bagi pengguna yang memilih untuk menggunakan CDN, atau tapak pengehosan.  Sumber boleh termasuk kad liar contohnya: *.mydomain.com, atau protokol, contohnya: https://*.example.com.  Sumber Alternatif ini hanya merangkumi jenis Imej, CSS dan JavaScript."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL di mana pelayar melakukan POST laporan pelanggaran CSP dalam mod nonce-report dan nonce. Biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan /cacti/csp_report.php pada root pemasangan. Mesti mengandungi aksara URL yang selamat sahaja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Dayakan Penciptaan Graf Automatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Apabila dilumpuhkan, Automasi Kadupul tidak akan mencipta sebarang Graf secara aktif.  Ini berguna apabila melaraskan tetapan Peranti bagi mengelakkan penciptaan Graf baharu setiap kali anda menyimpan objek.  Memanggil Peraturan Automasi secara manual masih boleh dilakukan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Dayakan Penciptaan Item Pokok Automatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Apabila dilumpuhkan, Automasi Kadupul tidak akan mencipta sebarang Item Pokok secara aktif.  Ini berguna apabila melaraskan tetapan Peranti atau Graf bagi mengelakkan penciptaan Entri Pokok baharu setiap kali anda menyimpan objek.  Memanggil Peraturan secara manual masih boleh dilakukan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "E-mel Penerima Pemberitahuan Automasi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the Primary Kadupul Admin's Email account."
msgstr "Alamat E-mel untuk menghantar E-mel Pemberitahuan Automasi jika tidak dinyatakan pada peringkat Rangkaian Automasi.  Jika medan ini, atau nilai Rangkaian Automasi dibiarkan kosong, Kadupul akan menggunakan akaun E-mel Pentadbir Kadupul Utama."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Nama Pengirim Pemberitahuan Automasi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Nama E-mel yang digunakan untuk E-mel Pemberitahuan Automasi jika tidak dinyatakan pada peringkat Rangkaian Automasi.  Jika medan ini, atau nilai Rangkaian Automasi dibiarkan kosong, Kadupul akan menggunakan Nama Pengirim lalai sistem."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "E-mel Pengirim Pemberitahuan Automasi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Alamat E-mel yang digunakan untuk E-mel Pemberitahuan Automasi jika tidak dinyatakan pada peringkat Rangkaian Automasi.  Jika medan ini, atau nilai Rangkaian Automasi dibiarkan kosong, Kadupul akan menggunakan Alamat E-mel Pengirim lalai sistem."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Lalai Templat Graf"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Uji Sumber Data Templat Graf"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Tandakan kotak semak ini jika anda ingin menguji Sumber Data sebelum ia dicipta bagi Templat Graf baharu dan yang baru diimport.  Dengan Uji Sumber Data didayakan, jika Sumber Data tidak mengembalikan data yang sah, Graf tidak akan dicipta.  Tetapan ini penting jika anda ingin mempunyai Templat Peranti yang lebih generik yang boleh merangkumi lebih banyak Templat Graf yang boleh digunakan secara terpilih bergantung pada ciri Peranti itu sendiri.  Nota: Jika anda mempunyai skrip yang berjalan lama sebagai Sumber Data, masa untuk mencipta Graf akan bertambah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Format Imej lalai yang digunakan untuk semua Templat Graf baharu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Height to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ketinggian Graf lalai yang digunakan untuk semua Templat Graf baharu."

#: include/global_settings.php
