msgstr "Mengikut Templat/Pertanyaan Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Management"
msgstr "Pengurusan Log"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Log Tail Lines"
msgstr "Baris Ekor Log Lalai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default number of lines of the Kadupul log file to tail."
msgstr "Bilangan baris lalai bagi fail log Kadupul yang akan diekorkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of rows per page"
msgstr "Bilangan baris maksimum setiap halaman"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "User defined number of lines for the CLOG to tail when selecting 'All lines'."
msgstr "Bilangan baris tentuan pengguna untuk CLOG diekorkan apabila memilih 'Semua baris'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Tail Refresh"
msgstr "Segar Semula Ekor Log"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How often do you want the Kadupul log display to update?"
msgstr "Berapa kerap anda mahu paparan log Kadupul dikemas kini?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Viewer Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Pemapar Log"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Exclusion Regex"
msgstr "Regex Pengecualian"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any strings that match this regex will be excluded from the user display.  <strong>For example, if you want to exclude all log lines that include the words 'Admin' or 'Login' you would type '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"
msgstr "Mana-mana rentetan yang sepadan dengan regex ini akan dikecualikan daripada paparan pengguna.  <strong>Contohnya, jika anda mahu mengecualikan semua baris log yang mengandungi perkataan 'Admin' atau 'Login' anda akan menaip '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Real-time Graphs"
msgstr "Graf Masa Nyata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Real-time Graphing"
msgstr "Dayakan Pengegrafan Masa Nyata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an option is checked, users will be able to put Kadupul into Real-time mode."
msgstr "Apabila pilihan ditandakan, pengguna akan dapat meletakkan Kadupul dalam mod Masa Nyata."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Graph Timespan"
msgstr "Rentang Masa Graf"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The timespan you wish to see on the default graph."
msgstr "Rentang masa yang anda mahu lihat pada graf lalai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Selang Segar Semula Minimum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Ini ialah masa minimum yang disokong antara kemas kini Graf.  Nilai ini juga digunakan untuk menetapkan atribut RRDfile tertentu.  Jika anda mempunyai Peranti yang menyimpan data dalam cache dan tidak menyediakan kemas kini masa nyata, anda mungkin perlu meningkatkan Selang Segar Semula Minimum lalai untuk mengelakkan penciptaan Graf yang mempunyai jurang."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cache Directory"
msgstr "Direktori Cache"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Ini ialah lokasi, pada pelayan web, di mana RRDfile dan fail PNG akan dicache.  Cache ini akan diurus oleh poller.  Pastikan anda mempunyai kebenaran baca dan tulis yang betul pada folder ini"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Graph Options"
msgstr "Pilihan Graf RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Watermark"
msgstr "Tera Air Tersuai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Text placed at the bottom center of every Graph."
msgstr "Teks yang diletakkan di tengah bawah setiap Graf."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Date Format"
msgstr "Format Tarikh Tersuai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To be used when formatting |date_time| on a graph"
msgstr "Untuk digunakan apabila memformat |date_time| pada graf"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable RRDtool Watermark"
msgstr "Lumpuhkan Tera Air RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Provided your RRDtool version supports it, you may disable RRDtool advertisement on your Graphs by checking this option."
msgstr "Dengan syarat versi RRDtool anda menyokongnya, anda boleh melumpuhkan iklan RRDtool pada Graf anda dengan menandakan pilihan ini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Font Selection Method"
msgstr "Kaedah Pemilihan Fon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How do you wish fonts to be handled by default?"
msgstr "Bagaimanakah anda mahu fon dikendalikan secara lalai?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/api_device.php
msgid "System"
msgstr "Sistem"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Font"
msgstr "Fon Lalai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Apabila tidak menggunakan kawalan fon berasaskan Tema, penerangan fon Pango yang digunakan untuk semua Graf, seperti DejaVu Sans. Secara pilihan, anda boleh membiarkannya kosong dan mengawal tetapan fon bagi setiap objek."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Business Hours Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Waktu Perniagaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Start of Business Day"
msgstr "Permulaan Hari Perniagaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Masa waktu perniagaan anda bermula. Format: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "End of Business Day"
msgstr "Penghujung Hari Perniagaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Masa waktu perniagaan anda berakhir. Format: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Sembunyikan Hujung Minggu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Tunjukkan waktu perniagaan pada hari bekerja sahaja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Tunjukkan waktu perniagaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Paparkan waktu perniagaan pada graf rrd."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Warna untuk waktu perniagaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Warna yang akan ditunjukkan untuk waktu perniagaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Bilangan hari maksimum untuk menunjukkan waktu perniagaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Selepas bilangan hari ini, waktu perniagaan tidak akan ditambah pada graf. <br/>Disyorkan: 62 hari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Pengumpulan Data Didayakan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Jika anda ingin menghentikan proses tinjauan sepenuhnya, nyahtanda kotak ini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Sokongan Ejen SNMP Didayakan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Kadupul will populate SNMP Agent tables with Kadupul device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Jika pilihan ini ditandakan, Kadupul akan mengisi jadual Ejen SNMP dengan maklumat peranti dan sistem Kadupul.  Ia tidak mendayakan Ejen SNMP itu sendiri."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Jenis Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take effect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Jenis poller yang digunakan.  Tetapan ini akan berkuat kuasa pada selang tinjauan seterusnya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Selang Segerak Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Selang segerak tinjauan lalai yang digunakan apabila mencipta poller.  Tetapan ini akan mempengaruhi kekerapan poller jauh disemak dan dikemas kini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Selang tinjauan yang digunakan.  Tetapan ini akan mempengaruhi kekerapan RRDfile disemak dan dikemas kini.  <strong><u>NOTA: Jika anda menukar nilai ini, anda mesti mengisi semula cache poller.  Kegagalan berbuat demikian boleh mengakibatkan kehilangan data.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Selang Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Kekerapan pengumpul data Kadupul akan dimulakan.  Anda boleh menggunakan crontab, tugas berjadual (untuk windows), atau perkhidmatan systemd cactid untuk mengawal pelancaran pengumpul data Kadupul.  Untuk arahan menggunakan daemon cactid, semak fail README.md dalam direktori service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Imbangkan Beban Proses"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Jika anda memilih pilihan ini, Kadupul akan cuba mengimbangkan beban setiap proses poller dengan mengagihkan item poller secara sama rata bagi setiap proses."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Lebar Output Nyahpepijat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will check for output that exceeds Kadupul's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Jika anda memilih pilihan ini, Kadupul akan menyemak output yang melebihi keupayaan Kadupul untuk menyimpannya dan mengeluarkan amaran apabila menemuinya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Lumpuhkan Semakan OID Meningkat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Mengawal pelumpuhan semakan OID meningkat semasa melalui pokok OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Ejen Jauh"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Kadupul web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Kadupul Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Tempoh masa, dalam saat, yang akan ditunggu oleh pelayan web Kadupul Pusat untuk respons daripada Pengumpul Data Jauh bagi mendapatkan pelbagai maklumat Peranti sebelum meninggalkan permintaan.  Pada Peranti yang dikaitkan dengan Pengumpul Data selain Pengumpul Data Kadupul Pusat, Ejen Jauh mesti digunakan untuk mengumpul maklumat Peranti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Saiz Ambil SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OIDs should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Berapa banyak OID yang patut dikembalikan bagi setiap permintaan snmpbulkwalk?  Untuk Peranti dengan pokok SNMP yang besar, meningkatkan saiz ini akan meningkatkan prestasi indeks semula melalui WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Had OID SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Bilangan maksimum lalai OID SNMP Get yang dikeluarkan bagi setiap permintaan snmpget.  Untuk Peranti, tetapan ini dikawal pada peringkat Peranti.  Anda hanya patut menggunakan tetapan ini apabila menggunakan API SNMP Kadupul secara natif dalam skrip atau pemalam anda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Retention"
msgstr "Pengekalan Sampel Ditolak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Jam sampel yang ditolak oleh RRDtool, contohnya selepas perubahan skema sumber data, kekal dalam baris gilir untuk cuba semula sebelum dialihkan ke jadual poller_output_rejected.  Baiki RRDfile, kemudian jalankan cli/replay_rejected_samples.php untuk memprosesnya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Limit"
msgstr "Had Sampel Ditolak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Bilangan maksimum sampel ditolak yang boleh disimpan dalam baris gilir oleh satu sumber data.  Sampel tertua melebihi had ini dialihkan ke jadual poller_output_rejected serta-merta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Lumpuhkan Replikasi Cache Sumber"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Secara lalai, Pengumpul Data Kadupul utama akan menyimpan keseluruhan tapak web dan pemalam ke dalam Cache Sumber.  Kemudian, secara berkala Pengumpul Data Jauh akan mengemas kini diri mereka dengan sebarang kemas kini daripada Pengumpul Data Kadupul utama.  Cache Sumber ini pada dasarnya membolehkan Pengumpul Data Jauh menaik taraf diri sendiri.  Jika anda tidak mahu menggunakan pilihan ini, anda boleh melumpuhkannya menggunakan tetapan ini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Pengumpul Data Tambahan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Pengelogan Data Tidak Sah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Bagaimanakah anda mahu ralat output Pengumpul Data dilog?  Pilihan termasuk: 'Terperinci' yang memperincikan setiap ralat, 'Ringkasan' yang menyediakan bilangan ralat output bagi setiap Peranti, dan 'Tiada', yang tidak menyediakan kiraan ralat."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Terperinci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Bilangan Pelayan Skrip PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Bilangan proses pelayan skrip serentak yang dijalankan bagi setiap proses spine.  Tetapan antara 1 dan 15 diterima.  Parameter ini akan membantu jika anda menjalankan beberapa thread dan skrip pelayan skrip dan hanya sah untuk Pengumpul Data spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Nilai Tamat Masa Skrip dan Pelayan Skrip"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Masa maksimum yang akan ditunggu oleh spine untuk skrip selesai.  Nilai tamat masa ini dalam saat dan hanya sah untuk Pengumpul Data spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Indeks Semula Semua Peranti Berkala"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Jadual Indeks Semula Semua Peranti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Pada kekerapan apakah anda ingin Mengindeks Semula semua Peranti.  Indeks Semula ini akan berlaku pada tengah malam pada kekerapan yang anda pilih."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Mingguan pada hari Ahad"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Bulanan pada hari Ahad"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Tamat Masa Latar Belakang dan Proses Serentak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Penjanaan Laporan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Masa maksimum skrip Penjanaan Laporan Kadupul boleh berjalan tanpa menjana ralat tamat masa dan dihentikan."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s Minit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Statistik Sumber Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Masa maksimum skrip Statistik Sumber Data Kadupul boleh berjalan tanpa menjana ralat tamat masa dan dihentikan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Masa maksimum skrip semakan RRDfile Kadupul boleh berjalan tanpa menjana ralat tamat masa dan dihentikan."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s Jam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Arahan Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Masa maksimum skrip Arahan Latar Belakang Kadupul boleh berjalan tanpa menjana ralat tamat masa dan dihentikan.  Skrip ini akan melaksanakan tugas seperti mengindeks semula Peranti dan memangkas peranti daripada Pengumpul Data Jauh."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Proses Serentak Arahan Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  There will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Bilangan proses Arahan Poller serentak.  Akan terdapat paling banyak satu arahan serentak bagi setiap hos dalam kolam Arahan Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Proses"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Proses"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Penjanaan Latar Belakang Penyelenggaraan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Masa maksimum skrip Penyelenggaraan Kadupul boleh berjalan tanpa menjana ralat tamat masa dan dihentikan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Penjanaan Latar Belakang Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Masa maksimum skrip Spikekill Kadupul boleh berjalan tanpa menjana ralat tamat masa dan dihentikan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Lalai Pengumpul Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Tetapan ini diselenggara pada peringkat Pengumpul Data.  Nilai di sini hanyalah lalai yang digunakan apabila mula-mula mencipta Pengumpul Data."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Proses Pengumpul Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Bilangan proses serentak lalai untuk dilaksanakan bagi setiap Pengumpul Data.  NOTA: Bermula daripada Kadupul 1.2, tetapan ini diselenggara dalam Pengumpul Data.  Seterusnya, nilai ini hanyalah pratetap untuk Pengumpul Data.  Menggunakan nombor yang lebih tinggi apabila menggunakan cmd.php akan meningkatkan prestasi.  Peningkatan prestasi dalam Spine paling baik diselesaikan dengan parameter threads.  Apabila menggunakan Spine, kami mengesyorkan nombor yang lebih rendah dan memanfaatkan thread sebaliknya.  Apabila menggunakan cmd.php, gunakan tidak lebih daripada 2x bilangan teras CPU."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Thread Setiap Proses"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Thread Lalai yang dibenarkan bagi setiap proses.  NOTA: Bermula dalam Kadupul 1.2+, tetapan ini diselenggara dalam Pengumpul Data, dan ini hanyalah Pratetap.  Menggunakan nombor yang lebih tinggi apabila menggunakan Spine akan meningkatkan prestasi.  Walau bagaimanapun, pastikan anda mempunyai sambungan MySQL/MariaDB yang mencukupi untuk menyokong persamaan berikut: sambungan = pengumpul data * proses * (thread + pelayan skrip).  Anda juga mesti memastikan anda mempunyai sambungan lebihan yang mencukupi untuk sambungan log masuk pengguna."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Kaedah Pengesahan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Pengesahan Terbina Dalam</i> - Kadupul mengendalikan pengesahan pengguna, yang membolehkan anda mencipta pengguna dan memberi mereka hak ke kawasan berbeza dalam Kadupul.<br><br><i>Pengesahan Asas Web</i> - Pengesahan dikendalikan oleh pelayan web. Pengguna boleh ditambah atau dicipta secara automatik pada log masuk pertama jika Pengguna Templat ditakrifkan, jika tidak kebenaran tetamu yang ditakrifkan akan digunakan.<br><br><i>Pengesahan LDAP</i> - Membolehkan pengesahan terhadap pelayan LDAP. Pengguna akan dicipta secara automatik pada log masuk pertama jika Pengguna Templat ditakrifkan, jika tidak kebenaran tetamu yang ditakrifkan akan digunakan.  Jika modul LDAP PHP tidak didayakan, Pengesahan LDAP tidak akan muncul sebagai pilihan.<br><br><i>Pengesahan Domain LDAP/AD Berbilang</i> - Membolehkan pentadbir menyokong pelbagai kumpulan berbeza daripada direktori LDAP/AD yang berlainan untuk mengakses sumber Kadupul.  Sama seperti Pengesahan LDAP, modul LDAP PHP diperlukan untuk menggunakan kaedah ini.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Sokong Kuki Pengesahan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Jika pengguna mengesahkan dan memilih 'Kekalkan saya log masuk', kuki pengesahan akan dicipta pada komputer pengguna yang membolehkan pengguna itu kekal log masuk.  Kuki pengesahan tamat tempoh selepas 90 hari tidak digunakan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Pengguna Khas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Pentadbir Utama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Nama akaun pentadbiran utama yang akan menerima E-mel secara automatik apabila sistem Kadupul mengalami masalah.  Untuk menerima E-mel ini, pastikan tetapan mel anda betul, dan akaun pentadbiran mempunyai alamat E-mel yang ditetapkan."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Tiada Pengguna"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Pengguna Tetamu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Nama pengguna tetamu untuk melihat graf; ialah 'Tiada Pengguna' secara lalai."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Templat Pengguna"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Nama pengguna yang akan digunakan oleh Kadupul sebagai templat untuk pengguna Web Basic dan LDAP baharu; ialah 'guest' secara lalai.  Akaun pengguna ini akan dilumpuhkan daripada log masuk apabila dipilih."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Pengesahan Asas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Mesej Kegagalan Log Masuk Basic Auth"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Apabila menggunakan pengesahan asas, jika terdapat masalah memetakan nama pengguna kepada akaun Kadupul yang sah, mesej yang disertakan di sini akan dipaparkan kepada pengguna.  Ia boleh mengandungi teks dan HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Fail Peta Basic Auth"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Apabila menggunakan pengesahan asas, jika akaun asas perlu diterjemahkan kepada akaun log masuk yang berbeza, anda boleh menentukan fail CSV di sini untuk memetakan akaun asas kepada akaun log masuk yang dikehendaki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Keperluan Kerumitan Akaun Setempat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Panjang Minimum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ini ialah panjang minimum kata laluan yang dibenarkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Perlu Huruf Bercampur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Ini akan memerlukan kata laluan baharu mengandungi aksara huruf kecil dan huruf besar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Perlu Nombor"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Ini akan memerlukan kata laluan baharu mengandungi sekurang-kurangnya 1 aksara angka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Perlu Aksara Khas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Ini akan memerlukan kata laluan baharu mengandungi sekurang-kurangnya 1 aksara khas."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Paksa Kerumitan pada Kata Laluan Lama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Ini akan memerlukan semua kata laluan lama turut memenuhi keperluan kerumitan baharu semasa log masuk.  Jika tidak dipenuhi, ia akan memaksa penukaran kata laluan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Tamatkan Tempoh Akaun Tidak Aktif"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Ini ialah bilangan hari maksimum sebelum akaun tidak aktif dilumpuhkan.  Akaun Admin dikecualikan daripada dasar ini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Tamatkan Tempoh Kata Laluan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Ini ialah bilangan hari maksimum sebelum kata laluan ditetapkan untuk tamat tempoh."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Sejarah Kata Laluan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Ingat bilangan kata laluan lama ini dan tidak benarkan penggunaan semula."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 Perubahan"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d Perubahan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Penguncian Akaun"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Kunci Akaun"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Kunci akaun selepas sebanyak ini percubaan gagal dalam 1 jam."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 Percubaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d Percubaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Buka Kunci Automatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Akaun akan dibuka kuncinya secara automatik selepas sebanyak ini minit.  Walaupun kata laluan yang betul dimasukkan, akaun tidak akan dibuka kuncinya sehingga had masa ini dipenuhi.  Maksimum 1440 minit (1 Hari)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 Hari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Am LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Pelayan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Kadupul will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user."
msgstr "Senarai nama hos DNS atau alamat IP pelayan LDAP yang sah, dipisahkan ruang.  Kadupul akan cuba menggunakan pelayan LDAP dari kiri ke kanan untuk mengesahkan pengguna."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Port Standard"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "Port TCP untuk komunikasi Bukan-SSL termasuk LDAP + TLS.  Lalai ialah 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "Port SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "Port TCP untuk LDAPS bagi komunikasi SSL.  Lalai ialah 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Versi Protokol"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Versi Protokol untuk menyambung ke pelayan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Sambungan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Tamat Masa Sambungan Rangkaian dalam saat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Bind"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Tamat Masa Bind dalam saat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "Mod Nyahpepijat LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Jika Ditandakan, Kadupul akan melog maklumat LDAP tambahan ke log Kadupul semasa aktiviti Binding dan Carian."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Penyulitan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Penyulitan yang disokong oleh pelayan. NOTA: Apabila menggunakan LDAP + TLS anda mesti menggunakan versi 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Keperluan Sijil TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client.  Demand and Hard refuse a server whose certificate does not verify.  Never and Allow skip that check, so anyone on the network path can pose as the directory and read the passwords sent to it."
msgstr "Patutkah LDAP mengesahkan Sijil TLS apabila diterima oleh Klien.  Demand dan Hard menolak pelayan yang sijilnya tidak lulus pengesahan.  Never dan Allow melangkau semakan itu, jadi sesiapa sahaja pada laluan rangkaian boleh menyamar sebagai direktori dan membaca kata laluan yang dihantar kepadanya."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Rujukan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Dayakan atau Lumpuhkan rujukan LDAP.  Jika dilumpuhkan, ia boleh meningkatkan kelajuan carian."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mod"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Mod yang akan digunakan oleh Kadupul untuk cuba mengesahkan terhadap pelayan LDAP.<blockquote><i>Tiada Carian</i> - Tiada pencarian Distinguished Name (DN) berlaku, hanya cuba bind dengan format Distinguished Name (DN) yang diberikan.<br><br><i>Carian Tanpa Nama</i> - Cuba mencari nama pengguna dalam direktori LDAP melalui binding tanpa nama untuk mengesan Distinguished Name (DN) pengguna.<br><br><i>Carian Khusus</i> - Cuba mencari nama pengguna dalam direktori LDAP melalui Distinguished Name (DN) Khusus dan Kata Laluan Khusus untuk binding bagi mengesan Distinguished Name (DN) pengguna."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Distinguished Name (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Sintaks \"Distinguished Name\", yang terpakai untuk konfigurasi OpenLDAP dan Windows AD, menawarkan fleksibiliti dalam menentukan identiti pengguna. Untuk OpenLDAP, formatnya mengikut struktur ini: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD menyediakan sintaks alternatif: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, yang lazim dikenali sebagai \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". Dalam konteks ini, \"&lt;username&gt;\" mewakili nama pengguna khusus yang diberikan semasa gesaan log masuk. Ini amat berkaitan apabila beroperasi dalam mod \"Tiada Carian\", atau dengan \"Perlu Keahlian Kumpulan\" didayakan."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Perlu Keahlian Kumpulan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Memerlukan pengguna menjadi ahli kumpulan untuk disahkan. Tetapan kumpulan mesti ditetapkan agar ini berfungsi, mendayakannya tanpa tetapan kumpulan yang betul akan menyebabkan kegagalan pengesahan."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Kumpulan LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Distinguished Name (DN) Kumpulan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Distinguished Name bagi kumpulan yang pengguna mesti menjadi ahlinya."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Atribut Ahli Kumpulan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Ini merujuk kepada atribut khusus dalam direktori LDAP yang menyimpan nama pengguna ahli kumpulan.  Adalah penting untuk memastikan nilai atribut sejajar dengan konfigurasi yang dinyatakan dalam \"Distinguished Name\" atau nilai atribut sebenar boleh dicari menggunakan tetapan yang digariskan dalam \"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Jenis Ahli Kumpulan"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Menentukan sama ada pengguna menggunakan Distinguished Name penuh atau hanya Nama Pengguna dalam Atribut Ahli Kumpulan yang ditakrifkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Distinguished Name"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Carian Khusus LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Pangkalan Carian"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Pangkalan carian untuk mencari dalam direktori LDAP, seperti <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> atau <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Penapis Carian"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Penapis carian yang digunakan untuk mengesan pengguna dalam direktori LDAP, seperti untuk windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> atau untuk OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' diganti dengan nama pengguna yang dibekalkan pada gesaan log masuk. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Distinguished Name (DN) Carian"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Distinguished Name untuk binding Carian Khusus ke direktori LDAP."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Kata Laluan Carian"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Kata laluan untuk binding Carian Khusus ke direktori LDAP."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan CN LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Medan yang akan menggantikan Nama Penuh apabila mencipta pengguna baharu, diambil daripada LDAP. (pada windows: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-mel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Medan yang akan menggantikan E-mel yang diambil daripada LDAP. (pada windows: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "Pautan URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "URL Asas Pelayan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Ini ialah lokasi pelayan yang akan digunakan untuk pautan ke tapak Kadupul. Ini hendaklah termasuk subdirektori jika Kadupul tidak berjalan dari folder root."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Pilihan E-mel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Beritahu Pentadbir Utama tentang Isu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Kadupul server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Kadupul user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Kadupul's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "Dalam keadaan pelayan Kadupul mengalami masalah, patutkah Pentadbir Utama diberitahu melalui E-mel?  Akaun pengguna Kadupul Pentadbir Utama ditetapkan di bawah tab Pengesahan pada halaman tetapan Kadupul. Ia lalai kepada akaun 'admin'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "E-mel Ujian"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is an Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Ini ialah akaun E-mel yang digunakan untuk menghantar mesej ujian bagi memastikan semuanya berfungsi dengan betul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan Mel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan mel yang digunakan untuk menghantar mel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Ping Pelayan Mel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Ping Pelayan Mel sebelum menghantar E-mel ujian?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Alamat E-mel Pengirim"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ini ialah alamat E-mel yang akan dipaparkan sebagai pengirim E-mel."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Nama Pengirim"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ini ialah nama sebenar yang akan dipaparkan sebagai pengirim E-mel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
