msgstr "Saiz maksimum mesej E-mel termasuk semua lampiran."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Kadupul Reporting"
msgstr "Tahap Pengelogan Poller untuk Pelaporan Kadupul"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file? WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Tahap perincian apakah yang anda mahu dihantar ke fail log? AMARAN: Membiarkan sebarang status selain NONE atau LOW boleh menghabiskan ruang cakera anda dengan pantas."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "Dayakan tweak Lotus Notes (R)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "Dayakan tweak kod untuk pengendalian khusus Klien Mel Lotus Notes."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "Pilihan DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Alamat IP DNS Utama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Masukkan Alamat IP DNS utama yang digunakan untuk carian terbalik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Alamat IP DNS Sekunder"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Masukkan Alamat IP DNS sekunder yang digunakan untuk carian terbalik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Kadupul uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Sila masukkan tamat masa DNS dalam milisaat.  Kadupul menggunakan penyelesai DNS berasaskan PHP."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Kemas Kini RRD Atas Permintaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Dayakan Pengemaskinian RRD Atas Permintaan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Kadupul?  If you disable, this change will not take effect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this setting is required to be on."
msgstr "Patutkah Boost mendayakan pengemaskinian RRD atas permintaan dalam Kadupul?  Jika anda melumpuhkan, perubahan ini tidak akan berkuat kuasa sehingga selepas kitaran tinjauan seterusnya.  Apabila anda mempunyai Pengumpul Data Jauh, tetapan ini diperlukan untuk dihidupkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Pengemas Kini RRD Peringkat Sistem"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Sebelum Kemas Kini Atas Permintaan RRD Boleh Dikosongkan, larian poller mesti sentiasa berlalu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Berapa Kerap Boost Patut Mengemas Kini Semua RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Apabila anda mendayakan boost, fail RRD anda hanya dikemas kini apabila diminta oleh pengguna, atau apabila tempoh masa ini berlalu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Bilangan Proses Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Bilangan proses boost serentak yang digunakan untuk memproses semua RRD dalam jadual boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Processing Mode"
msgstr "Mod Pemprosesan Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Boost distributes RRD updates. Forked processes start the number of Boost processes above on every run. Message queue workers hand each partition to Messenger workers instead."
msgstr "Cara Boost mengagihkan kemas kini RRD. Proses forked memulakan bilangan proses Boost di atas pada setiap larian. Pekerja baris gilir mesej menyerahkan setiap partition kepada pekerja Messenger sebagai gantinya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Forked processes"
msgstr "Proses forked"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Message queue workers"
msgstr "Pekerja baris gilir mesej"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Rekod Maksimum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Jika jadual output boost melebihi saiz ini, dalam rekod, kemas kini akan berlaku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Item Sumber Data Maksimum Setiap Laluan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Untuk mengoptimumkan prestasi, pengemas kini RRD boost perlu tahu berapa banyak Item Sumber Data yang patut diambil dalam satu laluan.  Berhati-hati agar tidak menetapkan terlalu tinggi kerana prestasi pengegrafan semasa kemas kini besar boleh terjejas.  Jika anda mengalami kelembapan pengegrafan atau tinjauan semasa kemas kini, kurangkan nombor ini.  Nilai lalai ialah 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Panjang Argumen Maksimum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating system's Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Apabila boost menghantar arahan kemas kini kepada RRDtool, ia tidak boleh melebihi Panjang Argumen Maksimum sistem pengendalian.  Ini berbeza mengikut sistem pengendalian dan tahap kernel.  Contohnya: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ tanpa had"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Had Memori untuk Boost dan Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Jumlah memori maksimum untuk Poller Kadupul dan Poller Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Masa Larian Skrip Kemas Kini RRD Maksimum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log."
msgstr "Jika poller boost melebihi masa larian ini, amaran akan diletakkan dalam log cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable direct population of poller_output_boost table"
msgstr "Dayakan pengisian terus jadual poller_output_boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enables direct insert of records into poller output boost which results in a 25% time reduction in each poll cycle."
msgstr "Mendayakan sisipan terus rekod ke dalam poller output boost yang menghasilkan pengurangan masa 25% dalam setiap kitaran tinjauan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Log Nyahpepijat Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost poller process."
msgstr "Jika medan ini tidak kosong, Boost akan melog output RRDUpdate daripada proses poller boost."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Pencachean Imej"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Dayakan Pencachean Imej"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Patutkah pencachean imej didayakan?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Lokasi untuk Fail Imej"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Nyatakan lokasi di mana Boost patut meletakkan fail imej anda.  Fail ini akan dipadam secara automatik oleh poller apabila tamat tempoh."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik Sumber Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Dayakan Pengumpulan Statistik Sumber Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Patutkah Statistik Sumber Data dikumpulkan untuk sistem Kadupul ini?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Bilangan Proses DSStats"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Bilangan proses DSStats serentak yang digunakan untuk memproses semua Sumber Data."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Kekerapan Kemas Kini Harian"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Berapa kerap Statistik Harian patut dikemas kini?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Tetingkap Purata Setiap Jam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Bilangan jam berturut-turut yang mewakili purata setiap jam.  Ingat bahawa tetapan yang terlalu tinggi boleh menghasilkan jadual memori yang sangat besar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Masa Penyelenggaraan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "Pada waktu bila Data Mingguan, Bulanan, dan Tahunan patut dikemas kini?  Formatnya ialah HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Had Memori untuk Pengumpul Data Statistik Sumber Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Jumlah memori maksimum untuk Poller Kadupul dan Poller Statistik Sumber Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Native Alerting"
msgstr "Penggera Natif"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Native Alert Evaluation"
msgstr "Dayakan Penilaian Penggera Natif"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should the main Data Collector evaluate alert rules after each polling cycle and send their notifications? Alert rules read the rates that Data Source Statistics collects, so Data Source Statistics Collection must also be enabled."
msgstr "Patutkah Pengumpul Data utama menilai peraturan penggera selepas setiap kitaran tinjauan dan menghantar pemberitahuannya? Peraturan penggera membaca kadar yang dikumpulkan oleh Statistik Sumber Data, jadi Pengumpulan Statistik Sumber Data juga mesti didayakan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Rules per Batch"
msgstr "Peraturan Penggera Setiap Kelompok"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Bilangan peraturan penggera yang dibaca dan dinilai bersama. Belanjawan masa disemak antara kelompok."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Rules"
msgstr "%d Peraturan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Evaluation Time Budget"
msgstr "Belanjawan Masa Penilaian Penggera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long one evaluation run may start new batches of rules. Sending queued notifications follows evaluation with the time left, and may send one batch even when the budget is spent. Rules not reached are evaluated first by the next run."
msgstr "Berapa lama satu larian penilaian boleh memulakan kelompok peraturan baharu. Penghantaran pemberitahuan dalam baris gilir menyusul selepas penilaian dengan masa yang berbaki, dan boleh menghantar satu kelompok walaupun belanjawan telah habis. Peraturan yang tidak dicapai dinilai dahulu oleh larian seterusnya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Semakan RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Dayakan Semakan RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Patutkah semakan RRDfile didayakan untuk sistem Kadupul ini?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "Bilangan Proses Semakan RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Bilangan proses semakan RRDfile serentak yang digunakan untuk memproses semua fail rrd."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Kekerapan Semakan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should RRD be checked?"
msgstr "Berapa kerap RRD patut disemak?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Storan Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Pilih sama ada RRD akan disimpan secara setempat atau dikendalikan oleh pelayan proksi RRDtool luaran."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "Pelayan Proksi RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Struktur Laluan RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Dayakan Laluan Berstruktur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each host's RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Gunakan subfolder berasingan untuk fail RRD setiap hos.  Penamaan RRDfile akan menjadi salah satu daripada yang berikut:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Anda boleh membuat perubahan ini selepas pemasangan dengan menjalankan skrip CLI <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> selepas anda membuat perubahan.  NOTA: Jika anda menukar nilai Direktori Maks untuk mengurangkan bilangan direktori, atau jika anda menukar Corak Direktori, direktori kosong tidak akan dipangkas selepas anda menjalankan semula skrip <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Corak Direktori"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths?  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Corak Direktori manakah yang anda mahu gunakan untuk Laluan RRD Berstruktur?  'ID Peranti' ialah lalai.  Tetapan 'ID Peranti/ID Pertanyaan Data' patut digunakan apabila anda mempunyai Peranti dengan beribu-ribu Graf.  Selepas Menukar Corak Direktori, anda mesti menjalankan semula skrip CLI Laluan Berstruktur untuk mengubah suai laluan RRDfile kepada Corak baharu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "ID Peranti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "ID Peranti/ID Pertanyaan Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Cincangan Peranti/ID Peranti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Cincangan Peranti/ID Peranti/ID Pertanyaan Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Device Hash Directories"
msgstr "Direktori Cincangan Peranti Maks"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device IDs."
msgstr "Bilangan maksimum Direktori Peranti yang akan dicipta berdasarkan ID Peranti yang dicincang."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Pelayan Proksi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Nama hos DNS atau alamat IP pelayan proksi RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Nombor Port Proksi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "Port TCP untuk komunikasi disulitkan."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "Cap Jari RSA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Cap jari kunci awam RSA semasa yang digunakan oleh proksi.  Ini diperlukan untuk mewujudkan sambungan dipercayai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "Pelayan Proksi RRDtool - Sandaran"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Pengimbangan Beban"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Jika kedua-dua proksi utama dan sandaran boleh diterima, pilihan ini membolehkan semua permintaan terhadap RRDtool diagihkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Nama hos DNS atau alamat IP pelayan proksi sandaran RRDtool jika proksi berjalan dalam mod MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "Port TCP untuk komunikasi disulitkan dengan proksi sandaran."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Cap jari kunci awam RSA semasa yang digunakan oleh proksi sandaran.  Ini diperlukan untuk mewujudkan sambungan dipercayai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Spike Kill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Kaedah Pembuangan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Terdapat dua kaedah pembuangan.  Yang pertama, Sisihan Piawai, akan membuang sebarang sampel yang berada X sisihan piawai daripada purata sampel.  Kaedah kedua, Varians, akan membuang sebarang sampel yang X% lebih daripada purata Varians.  Kaedah Varians mengambil kira bilangan tertentu 'outlier'.  Itulah sampel luar biasa, seperti lonjakan, yang perlu dikecualikan daripada pengiraan Purata Varians."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Sisihan Piawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Berasaskan Varians dengan Outlier Dibuang"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Kaedah Penggantian"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Terdapat tiga kaedah penggantian.  Kaedah pertama menggantikan lonjakan dengan purata sumber data yang berkenaan.  Kaedah kedua menggantikan lonjakan dengan 'NaN'.  Yang terakhir menggantikan lonjakan dengan nilai baik terakhir yang diketahui."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Purata"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaNs"
msgstr "NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Baik Terakhir Diketahui"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Bilangan Sisihan Piawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Sebarang nilai yang melebihi purata sebanyak sisihan piawai ini akan dikecualikan.  Nombor yang baik bergantung pada jenis data yang dikendalikan.  Kami mengesyorkan nombor tidak kurang daripada 5 Sisihan Piawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Sisihan Piawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Peratusan Varians"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
